  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The use of the dwellinghouse at 131 Kenton Lane, Harrow Weald, Harrow, HA3 8UJ, has been in use as 2no. self-contained flats is immune from enforcement action and is therefore lawful under S.171B of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended).&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The documents/information submitted, in the absence of any conflicting evidence, is satisfactory to prove, on the balance of probabilities, the use of the dwellinghouse at 131 Kenton Lane, Harrow Weald, Harrow, HA3 8UJ, has been in use as 2no. self-contained flats for a continuous period of at least 10 years prior to the date of this application on the balance of probability. The existing development is therefore considered to be lawful and as such the Local Planning Authority refuse to issue a Certificate of Lawful Existing Development.&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
